\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, my strength, my hope,
\par On Thee I cast my care,
\par With humble confidence look up,
\par And know Thou hear'st my prayer.
\par Give me on Thee to wait,
\par Till I can all things do,
\par On Thee, almighty to create,
\par Almighty to renew.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I want a godly fear,
\par A quick discerning eye
\par That looks to Thee when sin near,
\par And sees the tempter fly:
\par A spirit still prepared,
\par And armed with jealous care,
\par For ever standing on its guard
\par And watching unto prayer.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I want a true regard,
\par A single, steady aim,
\par Unmoved by threatening or reward,
\par To Thee and Thy great name;
\par A jealous, just concern
\par For Thine immortal praise;
\par A pure desire that all may learn
\par And glorify Thy grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I rest upon Thy word;
\par The promise is for me;
\par My succour and salvation, Lord,
\par Shall surely come from Thee:
\par But let me still abide,
\par Nor from my hope remove,
\par Till Thou my patient spirit guide
\par Into Thy perfect love.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

